# tc-webshare Basic auth template - PLACEHOLDER ONLY, NOT A REAL PASSWORD.
#
# Format (one user per line):  username:crypt(3)-hash
# thttpd reads the file via the symlink in /Volumes/dk2/share/web/.htpasswd.
#
# deploy/install.sh overwrites this file on the target from one of:
#   TC_WEB_PASS_HASH   pre-computed crypt(3) hash (preferred)
#   TC_WEB_PASSWORD    plaintext supplied on the command line, hashed locally
#   (neither)          a one-time random password generated and printed once
#
# Never commit a real hash to this repository.
admin:REPLACE_WITH_CRYPT3_HASH_NOT_A_REAL_CREDENTIAL
